# 🔧 PX4 Firmware Binaries

Firmware binaries for the Bumblebee flight controller (Pixhawk FMU-v6C, board target `px4_fmu-v6c_default`).

| File | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| `px4_v1_0_0.bin` | Current firmware build |

## Flashing

In **QGroundControl**: *Vehicle Setup → Firmware → Advanced settings → Custom firmware file* → pick the `.bin`. After flashing, restore the parameter snapshot from `../PX4_parameters/`.

Full procedure (including DFU recovery for a bricked board):
👉 **[PX4 Firmware — Bumblebee Students Wiki](https://github.com/futureLabKezad/bumblebee-students/wiki/PX4‐Firmware)**
